From 0b5c98b6e3e40827f87fd7be15b15f3ed5eb9c85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AsdreamChan <53651187+AsdreamChan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 02:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] imx8mp_frdm: scan the SD card first and boot only through
 extlinux

bootflow scan ran the global efi_mgr bootmeth and then walked
boot_targets in the order usb0 mmc1 mmc2 dhcp. On this board that cost
about 2 s before the SD card was reached: efi_mgr failed to open an
OP-TEE session (0.15 s), and bringing up USB took 1.8 s with nothing
bootable attached.

Put mmc1 first, so the other devices are scanned only when the SD card
has no bootflow, and limit bootmeths to extlinux, which is how this
layer boots. EFI, boot scripts and PXE are no longer tried by bootflow
scan; bsp_bootcmd still runs if it finds nothing.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [configuration for this layer's extlinux boot]
Signed-off-by: AsdreamChan <53651187+AsdreamChan@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 board/nxp/imx8mp_frdm/imx8mp_frdm.env | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/board/nxp/imx8mp_frdm/imx8mp_frdm.env b/board/nxp/imx8mp_frdm/imx8mp_frdm.env
index 8e30c64a..fddebc53 100644
--- a/board/nxp/imx8mp_frdm/imx8mp_frdm.env
+++ b/board/nxp/imx8mp_frdm/imx8mp_frdm.env
@@ -45,7 +45,8 @@ jh_netboot=setenv fdtfile ${jh_root_dtb}; setenv jh_root_mem 0x16000000@0x400000
 
 boot_fdt=try
 boot_fit=no
-boot_targets=usb0 mmc1 mmc2 dhcp
+boot_targets=mmc1 mmc2 usb0 dhcp
+bootmeths=extlinux
 bootm_size=0x10000000
 console=ttymxc1,115200
 splashimage=0x50000000
